  \item Fractional residual $\delta_T(M) = \left|T_{\mathrm{UBP}}(M)-T_{\mathrm{GR}}(M)\right|/T_{\mathrm{GR}}(M)$.
  \item A table with sample values at representative masses (PBH, stellar, supermassive).
\end{itemize}

